k\"><span>Stories</span></a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n                    </ul>\r\n<div class=\"gl_nv_src_inp\">\n<div class=\"mf_finder_header\">\n              <mf-search-box\n                lang=\"en\"\n                submit-text=\"\"\n                ajax-url=\"https://finder.api.mf.marsflag.com/api/v1/finder_service/documents/2d82e4e2/search\"\n                serp-url=\"https://www.ricoh.com/search\"\n                doctype-hidden\n                sort-hidden\n                pagemax-hidden\n                imgsize-hidden\n                category-hidden\n                imgsize-default=\"3\"\n                input-placeholder=\"&nbsp;\"\n                search-history-hidden\n              ></mf-search-box>\n            </div>\n</div>                </div>\r\n\r\n                <template class=\"fn-menu_tpl-hamburger\">\r\n                    <button class=\"gl-menu_toggle-btn\" data-alt-open=\"Open\" data-alt-close=\"Close\"><span class=\"hide\">Menu</span></button>\r\n                </template>\r\n                <template class=\"fn-menu_tpl-back\">\r\n                    <button class=\"gl-menu_back-btn\">Home</button>\r\n                </template>\r\n                <template class=\"fn-menu_tpl-close\">\r\n                    <button class=\"gl-menu_close-btn\" data-alt-close=\"Close\"></button>\r\n                </template>\r\n            </nav>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"gl-header_utilities\">\r\n                <div class=\"gl-header_search\">\r\n                    <div class=\"gl-searchbox\">\r\n                        <form class=\"gl-searchbox_form\">\r\n                            <div class=\"gl-searchbox_item\">\r\n                                <div class=\"gl_nv_src_inp\">\n<div class=\"mf_finder_header\">\n              <mf-search-box\n                lang=\"en\"\n                submit-text=\"\"\n                ajax-url=\"https://finder.api.mf.marsflag.com/api/v1/finder_service/documents/2d82e4e2/search\"\n                serp-url=\"https://www.ricoh.com/search\"\n                doctype-hidden\n                sort-hidden\n                pagemax-hidden\n                imgsize-hidden\n                category-hidden\n                imgsize-default=\"3\"\n                input-placeholder=\"&nbsp;\"\n                search-history-hidden\n              ></mf-search-box>\n            </div>\n</div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </form>\r\n                        <button class=\"gl-searchbox_btn -modal js-modal\" type=\"button\" data-modal=\"gl-modal-search\"></button>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>                                                    <div class=\"gl-header_globe\">\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.ricoh.com/gateway\" class=\"gl-header_globe-btn\">\r\n                        <img src=\"https://www.ricoh.com/-/Media/Ricoh/Common/cmn_g_header_footer/img/icon/globe.svg\" class=\"gl-header_globe-icon\" alt=\"Change Country/Area\">\r\n                    </a>\r\n                        <span class=\"gl-header_globe-txt\">Global</span>\r\n                </div>        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</header>\r\n\r\n        <div id=\"contents\" class=\"\">\r\n            <div id=\"Main\">\r\n                \n    <div class=\"breadcrumb breadcrumb--borderBottom\">\n        <div class=\"breadcrumb__container\">\n            <div class=\"breadcrumb__inner\">\n                <ul class=\"breadcrumb__list\">\n<ul class=\"breadcrumb__list\">\n<li>\n  <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n  <a href=\"/sustainability\">Sustainability</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n  <a href=\"/sustainability/governance\">Governance</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n  <a href=\"/sustainability/governance/security/\">Information Security</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n  <a href=\"/sustainability/governance/security/products\">Product security</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n  <a href=\"/products/security/vulnerabilities/list_products\">Information List by Vulnerability</a>\n</li>    \n<li class=\"act\">\n  <span>List by Products or Services</span>\n</li>\n</ul>                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\r\n\r\n                \r\n                \n<div class=\"c-container\">\n        <div class=\"c-h1-b\" id=\"freepagetitle\">\n        <div class=\"c-margin-b\">\n            <div class=\"c-margin-b__inner\">\n                    <h1 class=\"c-h1-b__text\">\n                        List by Products or Services\n                    </h1>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"fxb-section\">\n<section class=\"c-section \" id=\"section01\">\n    <div class=\"f-child\">\n        <div class=\"c-margin-b\">\n            <div class=\"c-margin-b__inner\">\n                    <div class=\"c-text-a\">\n        \t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"c-section\" id=\"section01\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"f-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-margin-b\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-margin-b__inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-multiCol\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-linkCard c-linkCard--col1 c-linkCard--col1-wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-linkCard__item c-linkCard__item--layout2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-linkCard__inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-linkCard__textwrap\">This page offers the capability for visitors to search by product or service for vulnerabilities discovered and remedied in Ricoh products and services after October 1, 2022.</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-multiCol\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-linkCard c-linkCard--col1 c-linkCard--col1-wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-linkCard__item c-linkCard__item--layout2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"c-linkCard__inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--search //-->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"\" id=\"vulinfoApp\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"sortBoxWrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"sortBox__title\">Filter products and services</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"sortBox__subtitle\">Step1：Filter conditions</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<fieldset class=\"sort_radiobtGroup\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"sortByType\" name=\"sort\" value=\"type\" aria-controls=\"sortBox\" checked class=\"visually-hidden\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"sortByType\">Filter by Products or Services Type and Category</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"sortByName\" name=\"sort\" value=\"name\" aria-controls=\"sortBox__keyword\" class=\"visually-hidden\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"sortByName\">Filter by Products or Services Name</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"sortBox__subtitle\">Step2：Filter details</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sortBoxWrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"sortBox\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sortBoxInner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wrap__select\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dtl w100 sortbox_labelAndInput\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"filterByArea\">1.Products or Services type</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<select id=\"filterByArea\" class=\"c-select-b\" v-on:change=\"selectionArea\" name=\"filterByArea\" v-model=\"filterByArea\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"\" disabled>Select Products or Services type</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option v-for=\"option in optionsAreas\" v-bind:value=\"option\">{{ option }}</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dtl w100 sortbox_labelAndInput\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"filterByCategory\">2.Category</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<select id=\"filterByCategory\" class=\"c-select-b\" v-on:change=\"selectionCategory\" name=\"filterByCategory\" v-model=\"filterByCategory\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"\" disabled aria-label=\"Select category\">Select category</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option v-for=\"option in optionsCategories\" v-bind:value=\"option\">{{ option }}</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dtl w100 sortbox_labelAndInput\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"filterBySubCategory\">3.Subcategory</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<select id=\"filterBySubCategory\" class=\"c-select-b\" name=\"filterBySubCategory\" v-model=\"filterBySubCategory\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"\" disabled aria-label=\"Select subcategory\">Select subcategory</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option v-for=\"option in optionsSubCategories\" v-bind:value=\"option\">{{ option }}</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"button act01 js-btSearch\" type=\"button\" name=\"Submit\" value=\"SEARCH\" v-on:click=\"gotoSearch\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"sortBox__keyword\" hidden inert aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sortBoxInner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wrap__select\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dtl w100 sortbox_labelAndInput\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"inputKeywords\">Products or Services Name</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Input Products or Services Name\" class=\"nml\" v-model=\"filterByKeyword\" id=\"inputKeywords\" aria-describedby=\"keywordNote\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"keywordNote\" class=\"searchAttention\">OR search by multiple keywords is available. Please enter keywords separated by spaces in the search input field.</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"button act01 js-btSearch\" type=\"button\" name=\"Submit\" value=\"SEARCH\" v-on:click=\"gotoSearch\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sct_bg01\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cnt_max\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"list_productsTable__title\">Filtered results: {{totalNum}}items</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<template v-if=\"totalNum > 0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"nml_scrollAddWrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table class=\"nml nml_scroll\" style=\"margin-left: 0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<caption class=\"sr-only\">Filtered result list of products and services</caption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<thead>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<th>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>P